    description: "DEEP bakeoff assessment (aardvark-dns) argues that impl Display/From/Default for error types are architectural, not noise. Current blocklist suppresses all std trait implements edges. Options: (1) remove Display/From/Default from blocklist entirely, (2) only suppress when both sides are unresolved, (3) keep as-is (noise vs signal tradeoff). This is a design decision requiring human input."  # f3ed
